        "name": "ketigid",
        "username": "ketigid",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-25T01:54:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"AvalonXQ\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/d2c977/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> AvalonXQ:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Are we at least in agreement that the Nemesis rule doesn't cause hero or villain cards to deal more damage to <em>themselves</em>? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Absolute Zero will have super healing. Yay!</p>\n<p>So, what's the official ruling?</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:14:24.564Z",
