      {
        "id": 40727,
        "name": "Christopher",
        "username": "Christopher",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-25T13:26:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The official ruling is that whenever a target deals damage to a&nbsp;<strong>different&nbsp;</strong>target that shares the same nemesis icon, the damage is increased by 1. So, if you're playing with Legacy and Young Legacy, and Felicia punches her dad, the damage is increased by 1. But when Legacy playes Heroic Interception and damages himself, that damage is not increased.</p><p>Hope this helps!</p>",
