        "created_at": "2012-10-25T14:25:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had never even considered this. But I like it. We've tried Ennead on advanced twice and lost pretty hard. But maybe if we bring in someone like Nightmist to redirect damage from Ennead members to other Ennead members... This could work out well.</p>",
